        {
          "id": "96237b3b-d8b6-4843-be62-379dba24ea2e",
          "name": "Retrieve details about a specific document within a designated topic in the Proompty API. By sending a GET request to this endpoint with the corresponding topicId and documentId parameters, users can access information such as the document's content, creation date, and any associated metadata. The API responds with the document object in JSON format, containing the relevant details. In case the requested document or topic is not found, appropriate error responses are returned (404 for document not found, 500 for other errors), ensuring users receive accurate feedback regarding the status of their request.",
