          "name": "Delete a specific document within a designated topic in the Proompty API. Users can send a DELETE request to this endpoint with the relevant topicId and documentId parameters to remove the specified document from the topic. The API responds with a success message in JSON format, confirming that the document has been successfully deleted. In case the requested document or topic is not found, appropriate error responses are returned (404 for document not found, 500 for other errors), ensuring users receive accurate feedback regarding the status of their request.",
